  "rte": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-c26bb7a766@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Key benefits</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Anatomic restoration of the joint<sup>1</sup></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Restoration of the joint is more reliable due to the centering of the prosthesis on the humeral cut surface, avoiding humeral canal variables</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Proven fixation<sup>2</sup></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Successfully completed IDE trial with no signs of implant loosening, subsidence, or migration</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Canal sparing<sup>1</sup></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tornier Simpliciti does not violate the humeral canal, eliminating the need for diaphyseal preparation, which may aid in potential future revision cases intervention options<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Nov 30 2021 19:17:21 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  },
